{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_title", "source_sha256": "6b2b02591ba3ac806446e6738c3d788664f55488fecbd41132b36943ce9f60b2", "ja": "はじめてのキラメキ☆", "zh": "第一次的光辉☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8e40d94fc223bce9ef169e17851acc65da7a22ca69055e7fabb51560f11f9644", "ja": "公演でやってみたいコトに悩むやよい。\n他のメンバーと話し合う中で、『はじめて』\nの体験がキラキラしている事に気づく。そし\nて『はじめて』の気持ちがこもったやよいの\n元気な挨拶が、劇場に響き渡るのだった。", "zh": "弥生烦恼要在公演上做哪种尝试。\n在跟其他成员讨论的过程中，\n她发现了『第一次』的体验是多么耀眼。\n于是弥生满怀着『初心』，\n用她活力十足的招呼声响彻了剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b7c28e9d6f47746264f23bd52c0a395bde77f1502b2da0475dc7651f505fdb4", "ja": "（やよいのセンター公演に向けた準備は順調に進んで\nいる。今もなごやかにミーティング中だ）", "zh": "（弥生Center公演的准备进行得很顺利，\n现在也在和乐地开会中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "4a17fdc6a4448b68f621b631cc9e7d14ef5fb90cf17b3d733da231960cf608f6", "ja": "そういえば、この前のジュリアさんの公演も、\nカッコよかったよね！", "zh": "话说回来，\n上次茱莉亚姊姊的公演也很帅气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "ffe7c003d7fa77ef50357570fae7f7c2498c42535f046257b8e11f5e1f123701", "ja": "うん。桃子もあんなふうに、\nギター弾けるようになりたいな。", "zh": "嗯，桃子也好希望能像那样弹吉他喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "e9f108fbc1b841dda1491607b4ade06d45ee2beaa1751398cacb4400bdecfe08", "ja": "はは　サンキュ！\n興味あるなら、いつでも教えるぜ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢啦！\n有兴趣的话，我随时都能教你们喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "70351c7ad778e1a81a97650408cc3ee78781d45df3f57b2e87a7da52ea081f85", "ja": "ねえ、やよいがこの前言ってた『新しいコト』って、\n何か思いついた？", "zh": "欸欸，弥生上次说的『新的尝试』，\n有想到什么点子了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "383d2b53a4647bd40b6bd9410112db539785dc9b71e47f96563c8fe2ef613209", "ja": "うう、それが～……ずっと考えてたんだけど、\n頭の中がグルグルしてきちゃって～～～。", "zh": "唔唔，关于那个啊……我想了很久，\n想到头都晕了～～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "71e54b8deb3b544f84ff91e7f20ac3fb707b949984908a79acf20cad8944002b", "ja": "ふふ、やっぱりね。\nだったら、私も一緒に考えるわ。", "zh": "呵呵，我就知道。\n既然如此，我也一起想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee8978be57aed91f1ea4a6934ef10764df558a0047950fcb73a9cb9b512d3780", "ja": "あ、わたしも考えるよ！　みんなでがんばった方が、\nいいステージになるんだもんね！", "zh": "啊，我也一起想！\n大家一起努力，才会带来好表演嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "0e555100aaeed1ff9ed39c0089268d9a9fc338aefa95f75d418f78f665adf9cd", "ja": "そうだよ。桃子たちは、お手伝いするために\nいるんだから。やよいさん、遠慮とかしないでね。", "zh": "对呀，桃子我们是为了帮忙而来的。\n弥生姊，不要客气喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "a1b549e07b012424ac12eaf6eaaddb6627920e0fb9185505ade96dc239750567", "ja": "わあ……みんな、ありがとう！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "哇啊……谢谢你们！\n拜托你们了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "af6bf2df3597e184cda036273105f87146c6f3f4599887f50d2edccf92b05e15", "ja": "だったら、レッスンが終わった後に、\nみんなで話さないか？", "zh": "那训练课程结束之后，\n要不要大家一起讨论呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "ae80dbacad9d3ed630e182fcfbe54864b94b99b939aacb0170d69e8e96f1d1eb", "ja": "あっ、レッスンの後は……うう……。", "zh": "啊，训练课程结束后……唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "4b3a76b22330f772a7ea673383a0924fd849cf56ea1203c7a27ab73abcc6fc30", "ja": "ん？　ああゴメン、都合が悪いかな？", "zh": "嗯？啊，抱歉，你不方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "2fdd95ddf20fd5e701ac2f0ab65879825e34e7232d78fc53ebad6cafc539999d", "ja": "都合っていうか、近所のスーパーのタイムセール……\nううっ、でも、だ、大丈夫です～っ！", "zh": "也不是不方便，是附近的超市有限时特价……\n唔唔，不过，没、没关系～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "295f64e8cdff9b3ef5237824bd518a1f17e1162110e4f79e593c728a3f0e7cee", "ja": "い、いや、無理しなくていいって。うん、タイムセール\nは大事だよな！　じゃ、話はそのうちにってことで。", "zh": "不、不用勉强啦。嗯，限时特价很重要啊！\n那就之后再讨论吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "dc3ae5ecd21644bbf3b91e0e44ebf9ffb03b7d930413aad33468ebf4b92cb380", "ja": "でも、ゆっくり話せる時間なんてあるかしら。\nやよい、明日から外の現場でしょ？", "zh": "但我们有时间慢慢讨论吗？\n弥生不是从明天开始就要出外工作了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1016_p", "source_sha256": "29235d8ff56eaa83ca25fa00fc40c0abfcf60ffa796389bee516bc9b3c822d33", "ja": "そうだな。1週間ほど続くし、みんなもそれぞれ\n仕事だから、今日みたいに集まれるかどうか。", "zh": "没错，大约持续一个星期，其他人各自也有工作，\n不确定能不能跟今天一样聚在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "34b6985b0f0e71c3e33ac79e830437f60afe7c6addf483f544265afdbc14cc7a", "ja": "って、あんたはのん気に言ってないで、\nスケジュール調整しなさいよ！", "zh": "欸，你不要说得那么悠哉，\n调整一下行程啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1018_p", "source_sha256": "283b16e329ac16071d1aa3fdb58d31f30d994541f5d83d20cd7af2c056853760", "ja": "そ、そうだな。うーん、空いているのは夜だけ……\nとはいえ、みんなでやよいの家に行くワケにも……。", "zh": "让、让我想想喔，唔～有空的时间只有晚上……\n但也不能一群人跑去弥生家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "097b4070a85fee3f7cffb537c3071c01e09fae4f5a644ce682e50388c110675c", "ja": "みんなで、私の家……？", "zh": "大家一起来我家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "44cad0c514db853745d310d43611cc3a8287367fc4d61268612d60f0e8e1d9aa", "ja": "それだ！", "zh": "就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1023_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "6ac18ca3700a2383f89e5b251ae22a5f5fbf2d9be401b2e27b623890628aacd1", "ja": "いいアイディアじゃない！\nやよいの家でなら、ゆっくり話ができるわね。", "zh": "不错的点子嘛！\n去弥生家就能慢慢讨论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "0cdec70d5785a4a90c2ba8a37f2c11a3376b2c3141744a1f92285c0da44a77ec", "ja": "やよいさんの、おうちでのお仕事も\nお手伝いできるよね！", "zh": "这样也能帮忙弥生姊做家事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "71e5b783f85ac9d6b1b52efc59f35cba2224aab598d2ca3213b1a0fa7c97c72d", "ja": "やよいさん、わたし、おうちのお手伝いもじょうずに\nできるよ！　いつもおかあさんがほめてくれるんだ♪", "zh": "弥生姊姊，我很会帮忙做家事喔！\n我妈妈都会夸奖我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "d685bcadc6d7a31f5a434841605aeec3c073cb34cde8aae08d086aef9a325f89", "ja": "ヤッコ、どうだ？　4人……\nいや、5人で押しかけることになるけど。", "zh": "弥子觉得如何？虽然会有四个人……\n不对，是五个人过去打扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9fca54a69a35d3a098b77d044dfce18c3481aaa8e49a085775131f341116bbb2", "ja": "（あ、俺もか）", "zh": "（啊，包含我吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "edc9059701b2e5d3e03f5bcdc37be55f3d050c34a949ca418f10dd1400882dc5", "ja": "はい、大歓迎ですー！　お父さんとお母さんは\nいつも遅くて寂しいから、弟たちも喜ぶかなーって！", "zh": "非常欢迎──！我爸妈总是很晚回家，家里很冷清，\n所以我想弟弟妹妹他们应该会很开心──这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1030_p", "source_sha256": "236852e0f327740238b6358a3de6ecc711fcb5925e1b6140db611192ccc7d56d", "ja": "よし、やよいがいいなら、お邪魔させてもらおう。\n俺も仕事を調整しておくよ。", "zh": "好，弥生同意的话，我们就去府上打扰吧。\n我也会先把工作行程调整好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "2e8f35b5e35618cb7c4d9de8c9e0a4357c5bedb218f7acbd4efe0206e3a3da14", "ja": "晩ご飯も食べてってくださいねっ。ちょうど昨日の特売\nで、たくさん買えたから大丈夫ですー。えへへっ♪", "zh": "也顺便吃晚餐吧，我刚好趁昨天特卖大采购了，\n所以没问题，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1032_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "b0b11f1b7c97caff3d4f9f31102303668dbb6fdb34d63f656586281c761c093f", "ja": "それじゃあ私、先にご飯の準備してきますっ。\nみんなは、弟たちと遊んでもらってていいですか？", "zh": "那我先准备餐点，\n大家可以陪我的弟妹们玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "f4cbebfceceb927037c40f1b6af737bef0a0f694f6b872b2064ebc0ce2a58c86", "ja": "ああ、料理以外なら任せてくれ！\nヤッコのご飯、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "好，下厨以外的工作就交给我吧！\n我很期待弥子煮的饭喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
