{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_2025_005yay", "source_sha256": "971151d75146582a9efb8b7b46ef3bd15756bc9938ef97aeb3a70b091e4affed", "ja": "えへへ、ホントですか？　なんか恥ずかしいかも～。\nあ、伊織ちゃんも緊張したの？", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗？好像有点难为情呢～\n啊，伊织当时也很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
