{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_2027_007ior", "source_sha256": "379f85904cbef4f16f51024817d16bb3567ed79ea74b2fd9306fa80ada1cca38", "ja": "余計なこと言わなくていいのっ。\n私のことより、やよいのステージでしょ？", "zh": "不用多说废话。\n比起我怎么样，弥生的表演比较重要吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_2028_p", "source_sha256": "3c4942cf6dbb49979ad8a37855661f54effb81a8559dcbb64b6bbd87fe2366d2", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。初めてステージに立った時と\n同じくらいキラキラするために、劇場での公演は……。", "zh": "哎呀，差点忘了。\n为了跟首次站上舞台时同样耀眼，我认为剧场公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_2029", "source_sha256": "38bcc27db887a8f62c0343b15f996532546bd1f7f3a090e1cefd11cf3374f159", "ja": "いつも通り！", "zh": "跟平常一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3000_p", "source_sha256": "3273df65457d581a750270b0669003a20fd9b6f04a9de6544bb432ee6678d73e", "ja": "……うん。劇場での公演は、むしろ\nいつも通りがいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "……嗯，\n剧场公演跟平常一样反而比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3001_005yay", "source_sha256": "38a93856115083ad23cd0a5b3de6662c333feed5ca4178eb5698cdf5504c68c7", "ja": "えっ？　で、でも～、それだと\nはじめてって感じにならないかなーって……。", "zh": "咦？可、可是～\n我想这可能不会有第一次的新鲜感──这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3002_p", "source_sha256": "2f828cf6f4fb7ea3adb0b99ee6bb8d1145f0b899b59ae9523b3a08ab751f8051", "ja": "そうかな？\n意外とそうでもないと思うんだ。", "zh": "是吗？\n我认为其实并不会喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3003_050jul", "source_sha256": "baa9713709d3a583ea1c52f338bc18cfe04896be94fb717fb414a259d649fce7", "ja": "そういえば……最初にあたしも言ったな。\nヤッコの公演って聞いて、それがすごく楽しみだって。", "zh": "这么说来……我一开始也说过吧？\n听到是弥子的公演，我觉得非常期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3004_030iku", "source_sha256": "f288347d36e73f14c1c13247dd049573454a6debed9c0cdb115661561c7f1372", "ja": "わたしもだよ、やよいさん！　だって、やよいさんの\n劇場でのセンター公演って、はじめてだもん！", "zh": "我也是喔，弥生姊姊！\n因为弥生姊姊是第一次在剧场办Center公演嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3005_005yay", "source_sha256": "16cda6e175e44aa7ca8bba4d6ccca811fd049caaa545988e59d4597afadcb2f2", "ja": "劇場での……はじめて？", "zh": "第一次……在剧场办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3006_049mom", "source_sha256": "546cff7011b6d190e4007fe21546305d80870a0101aaf75d27122a9b067bc058", "ja": "桃子たちは、やよいさんたちの本当のはじめての\nステージを見れなかったから、ちょっと残念。", "zh": "桃子我们没办法看到弥生姊你们真正首次登台的样子，\n所以有点遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3007_049mom", "source_sha256": "e1c78a39253a3a87e3ccb5bf0f79ca9706bea3c1abaff0672c6139595ea67f7b", "ja": "でも……だからよけいに、はじめてのセンター公演が\nすっごく楽しみなのかも。", "zh": "不过……也许正因为如此，\n才会让桃子更加期待你第一次的Center公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3008_005yay", "source_sha256": "9dcdb040f0387d29ee8cc913b65c70cb0e669b6824f5f6c54b07c63f838c5b7c", "ja": "そうなの、桃子？　ジュリアさんも育ちゃんも……\n伊織ちゃんは？", "zh": "是吗，桃子？还有茱莉亚姊姊跟小育……\n伊织呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3009_007ior", "source_sha256": "023fd1ca1f3eddbaa9f16fbd5d0ca8a856abb64a85c9e316c53a54c4e5cf1752", "ja": "……もちろんよ！　やよいのセンター公演が\nどうなるのか、今からとっても楽しみだわ♪", "zh": "……我当然也是呀！\n我现在就好期待弥生的Center公演会多么精彩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3011_p", "source_sha256": "b4f34062b98435060dec7f86953a39ffc321d0257075f8972a7fd9f7f62b9644", "ja": "きっと、お客さんもそうだと思うんだ。\n765プロライブ劇場では、初めてだから。", "zh": "观众一定也是这么想的，\n因为这是你首次在765艺能演唱会剧场里举办。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3012_005yay", "source_sha256": "ac540a8ed1295edf2e75d0d7efd1b6f8e795b107decd93ff153af4b435d32851", "ja": "そっか……そっかぁ！\n{$P$}、なんかわかったかもです！", "zh": "这样啊……原来如此！\n{$P$}，我好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3013_005yay", "source_sha256": "357e50d1c187ad6c75af6b14d4d90f17fd869fb507e5ae033c9182ed42e41a1b", "ja": "私、あらためて「はじめまして」って、\n劇場と客席のみんなに、きちんとご挨拶しますねっ。", "zh": "我会重新向剧场和观众席的大家好好打招呼，\n说声「初次见面，大家好」──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3014_005yay", "source_sha256": "553a395bd6faae9dad8197136ff588ee49dc1ccf17bb32c51705f585108fc113", "ja": "それが私の、劇場でのはじめてってことかなーって！", "zh": "我想这应该就是我在剧场的第一次──这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3015_p", "source_sha256": "4cdf7f021bcae9a021681167481265a15fdc49294bc0c388d22d5a975d0669f1", "ja": "うん、いいと思う。やよいの新しいこと、それは……\nセンター公演そのものだ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得不错。\n弥生要做的新尝试就是……Center公演本身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3016_050jul", "source_sha256": "b24efab55bb4e42ad28f0c84fc2bccaff51ba1ad783c0774dc69a3599289b37b", "ja": "そうと決まれば、あたしも気合い入れないとな。\nヤッコのはじめましてを、思いっきり盛り上げるぜ！", "zh": "既然已经决定，我也得拿出干劲了。\n大家尽全力炒热弥子的第一次吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3017_030iku", "source_sha256": "4bde958770079dfb2f8a4de6d87d5223712c01325949c3b5167c05989da05d81", "ja": "わたしもがんばるね！　やよいさんが、はじめてで\n緊張したら、手をつないであげる♪", "zh": "我也会加油的！弥生姊姊要是因为第一次感到紧张，\n我会牵住你的手♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3018_049mom", "source_sha256": "97ca7ae617b73e228c5d07477514c13b4da790b1f1f1d5e7862d473e9bd9188a", "ja": "やよいさんなら大丈夫だと思うけど。\nでも、もしドキドキしたら、桃子もお話とか聞くね。", "zh": "桃子觉得弥生姊没问题的，\n但如果觉得紧张，桃子也会陪你聊聊喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3019_005yay", "source_sha256": "9a704ac217ed195a81bb181430ddfda8949b1d025cca4a4ff07249384689c16b", "ja": "えへへ、育ちゃんも桃子も、ありがとう！\nジュリアさんも、よろしくお願いしますねっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢小育和桃子！\n也请茱莉亚姊姊多多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3020_005yay", "source_sha256": "ee02f8ac529aef65e1b30bcaa5d1a6bb6e11fec9ced46e5bab90317801186133", "ja": "それから伊織ちゃんも、よろしくねっ！\nみんなでステキな公演にしちゃいましょー！", "zh": "然后也要麻烦伊织了！\n大家一起完成精彩的公演吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3021_p", "source_sha256": "1b1b103c2bda3eee1689574c33368ef1103ae60a3a1a74aa58575f77cb97192f", "ja": "（あらためての「はじめまして」。初心にかえった、\n元気なやよいのセンター公演になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（新一次的「初次见面」。\n这应该会成为弥生回归初心、充满活力的Center公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3022_null", "source_sha256": "4c1ee2751361d7d2b0734f89aaba5a329f4de4af4b568dce7d476b69e123581d", "ja": "そして、公演当日……", "zh": "接着，来到公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3023_005yay", "source_sha256": "ac1b9118d1ed6998beeaf5ba76b7d89700ca6f9d83d13ea34c32b83b0c6356df", "ja": "みなさん、はじめましてー！　高槻やよい、14歳っ。\n好きなものは家族で、特技はお買い物の計算です！", "zh": "初次见面，大家好──！我是高槻弥生，14岁。\n最喜欢家人，特技是精打细算地采买东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_049_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_049_3024_005yay", "source_sha256": "3673a18537115f88c53ed054df3266c8948543c0a262cf3175b61a9924b5e5d8", "ja": "私、劇場でセンターをするのがはじめてだから、\nご挨拶させてもらいましたっ！", "zh": "我是第一次在剧场担任Center，\n所以向大家打声招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
